    {
      "body": "spmd_types you linked doesn't pin to main, it pins to a fixed commit -- I wonder if we should do the same, or like attn-gym on stable versions",
      "created_at": "2026-10-13T20:19:02Z",
      "diff_hunk": "@@ -7,8 +7,8 @@ renderers == 0.1.11\n safetensors\n einops\n pillow\n-spmd_types @ git+https://github.com/meta-pytorch/spmd_types.git@a1b86deadc037988083bfacd747e01f77a3fa2a0\n+spmd_types @ git+https://github.com/meta-pytorch/spmd_types.git@2ae49fce3e0175b76aa55361e415fa1be0aabebb\n attn-gym[linear,cudnn]==0.0.16\n-torch_remat @ git+https://github.com/meta-pytorch/remat.git@624f19cbdb70720bd05988d6485a1225f46c074b\n+torch_remat @ git+https://github.com/meta-pytorch/remat.git@4fd000acba6dc66762b7f3217ecadb8e07243dd4\n # PyPI 0.1.0 predates torch_checkpointing.default_resharder.\n-torch_checkpointing @ git+https://github.com/meta-pytorch/torch_checkpointing.git@dcbb3a59cfad1cbeb95994f0d6cb1802c1d91825\n+torch_checkpointing @ git+https://github.com/meta-pytorch/torch_checkpointing.git@main",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/pytorch/torchtitan/pull/5355#discussion_r4263575314",
      "id": 4263575314,
      "line": 14,
      "original_line": 14,
      "path": ".ci/docker/requirements.txt",
      "updated_at": "2026-10-13T20:20:14Z",
      "user": {
        "login": "tianyu-l"
      }
    },
    {
      "body": "@aelavender is currently planning a change to the APIs for torch_checkpointing (after PTC 2026) to have better separation between components (e.g. DefaultResharder shouldn't have concurrency logic, we shouldn't have HF format specific code in generic components), so for now I think it would make more sense for us to pin use main. Does that make sense? torch_checkpointing unfortunately doesn't really have a stable version right now 😅 ",
      "created_at": "2026-10-13T20:31:34Z",
      "diff_hunk": "@@ -7,8 +7,8 @@ renderers == 0.1.11\n safetensors\n einops\n pillow\n-spmd_types @ git+https://github.com/meta-pytorch/spmd_types.git@a1b86deadc037988083bfacd747e01f77a3fa2a0\n+spmd_types @ git+https://github.com/meta-pytorch/spmd_types.git@2ae49fce3e0175b76aa55361e415fa1be0aabebb\n attn-gym[linear,cudnn]==0.0.16\n-torch_remat @ git+https://github.com/meta-pytorch/remat.git@624f19cbdb70720bd05988d6485a1225f46c074b\n+torch_remat @ git+https://github.com/meta-pytorch/remat.git@4fd000acba6dc66762b7f3217ecadb8e07243dd4\n # PyPI 0.1.0 predates torch_checkpointing.default_resharder.\n-torch_checkpointing @ git+https://github.com/meta-pytorch/torch_checkpointing.git@dcbb3a59cfad1cbeb95994f0d6cb1802c1d91825\n+torch_checkpointing @ git+https://github.com/meta-pytorch/torch_checkpointing.git@main",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/pytorch/torchtitan/pull/5355#discussion_r4263698123",
